Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Red-Buoy Diesel Engine Screams
- Story & Context: The genre was born when Aunty Sunee rammed her timber barge into a police patrol craft at the Tha Tien pier, locking her turntable arm onto a spinning jazz break while Chai redlined his horn over the diesel motor's roar. The resulting standoff drew dozens of market boats, turning a routine eviction attempt into a three-hour waterborne block party. Eyewitnesses recalled the wet smell of unburnt fuel and scorched brass as the crowd began chanting along with Sunee's makeshift megaphones. Over a crushing slap-bass groove, Sunee screamed through static, "We trade in fire while the river is dark!"
